---
import PhoneFan from "./PhoneFan.astro";
import CTAButton from "./CTAButton.astro";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden px-5 pt-[120px] pb-20 sm:px-6 sm:pt-[156px] sm:pb-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1040px] text-center">
    <p data-reveal class="chip">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 rounded-[3px]" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect width="32" height="32" fill="#DA291C" />
        <rect x="13" y="6" width="6" height="20" fill="#fff" />
        <rect x="6" y="13" width="20" height="6" fill="#fff" />
      </svg>
      Fait en Suisse
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-ash">·</span>
      <span class="text-slate">pour les associations</span>
    </p>

    <h1
      data-reveal
      data-content-key="hero.title"
      style="transition-delay: 60ms"
      class="t-hero mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[1000px] text-balance text-graphite"
    >
      Gérez votre association dans <span class="text-gradient-brand">une seule app.</span>
    </h1>

    <p
      data-reveal
      data-content-key="hero.subtitle"
      style="transition-delay: 120ms"
      class="t-lead mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[640px] text-pretty text-slate"
    >
      Konclav, c'est <em class="not-italic font-medium text-graphite">l'intranet privé pensé pour les associations suisses</em>.
      Tâches, agenda, documents, cotisations, AG, votations — toute la vie
      associative dans une seule app mobile.
    </p>

    <div
      data-reveal
      style="transition-delay: 180ms"
      class="mt-9 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-5 sm:flex-row"
    >
      <CTAButton href="/inscription" joinOpen size="lg">
        <span data-content-key="hero.cta_primary">S'inscrire</span>
      </CTAButton>
      <CTAButton href="#features" variant="link">Voir les fonctionnalités</CTAButton>
    </div>

    <p data-reveal style="transition-delay: 220ms" class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate">
      Essai 14 jours sans carte · Démarrage en 7 jours
    </p>
  </div>

  <div data-reveal style="transition-delay: 260ms" class="mt-16 sm:mt-20">
    <PhoneFan />
  </div>
</section>
